### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@teamId = 359758ea-e445-4283-9120-100e34b6c8f3
@profileId = 29ac3d70-55e5-4bf3-900e-25ff1fbbbb80

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### FOOD STOCKS — Créer les produits (sans photo d'abord)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 1. Bonbons Haribo
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/food-stocks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bonbons Haribo",
  "category": "bonbon",
  "packets_count": 20,
  "pieces_per_packet": 10,
  "purchased_at": "2026-03-10",
  "expires_at": "2026-09-01",
  "created_by": "{{profileId}}"
}

